ymptotically de Sitter solutions limit the N-bound and maximal mass conjecture when mass and entropy are defined through boundary counterterms and gravitational thermodynamics?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0112"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:69e0f8e881959dd758dc6e9e920e4d0e8921db1865aee42db04449e3226125e9","title":"What determines the density and supersymmetry-breaking scale distribution of metastable nonsupersymmetric vacua in supergravity ensembles, especially Type IIB flux compactifications, and how do near-zero vacuum energy and additional D-type contributions change the result?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0112"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"}],"relations":[{"id":"source-access:bbb77e880dc16c9de467a6db","source":"q025-candidate-question:fcb286e899efd10f36b8794c","target":"source-question:691981f6af05ad9dc5c6ab3ba826138bfe81c463b1dfa66d8136b2fb86f9fb9c","detail":{"shardId":"relation-details-0040","recordSha256":"ec09584960476c6796c48c8d884c866da18fe3a8b77c4cf15abc35b532b62d41"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-access:f32b1942cf4ad3b650eb62e3","source":"q025-candidate-question:426fcd23359f0bd5827befca","target":"source-question:69c751952a8db1d33b37105929f7c36ea0eef819126e14de43ef3cec3f8377d8","detail":{"shardId":"relation-details-0040","recordSha256":"891458c1c2d6da44ec2e145b881327b9d3a20c0ff8fdcbdbda80b25e9462a480"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-access:5b6ddf3960946f177f1c9f95","source":"q025-candidate-region:ee9cdbfeaa2ae8171f8454b4","target":"source-question:69a791d318757a8947129287c9a71d84857acb9a3be1526ba5386417f09507d0","detail":{"shardId":"relation-details-0040","recordSha256":"919c29f6cfcc9be7b33090990046bd833847251a7d4cddae5f4b901c79124ba9"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-access:b740a1fd410aa1606c37f8e9","source":"q025-candidate-region:277d9b2e77af3c3b06134952","target":"source-question:69ab822f